  "details": {
   "biography": {
    "value": "<p>A half-elf wizard in faded robes who has stopped pretending to be interested in magic. Everything he has to say is about the rod: the gadgetry, the satisfying mechanisms, what it can turn into. He will show it to anyone who stands still.</p><p><strong>Remnant.</strong> Max Hit Points, never rolled. It never attacks first. It cannot answer any question about its past that is not its Signature. It cannot leave a room by a door the party came through.</p>",
    "public": ""
   },
