     "spent": 0,
     "recovery": [],
     "max": ""
    },
    "description": {
     "value": "<p>Thon carries a heavy black rod studded with buttons, and once per round he presses one and it is exactly the right tool: a mace, a flaming blade, a battleaxe, a spear that extends to 50 feet, a ladder, a battering ram, a pole that points north. Whatever he uses it for that round succeeds without a roll. As a weapon it hits for [[/damage 1d8+4 bludgeoning]] plus [[/damage 2d6 fire]]; as a ram it opens any door that is not one the party came through; as a ladder or a pole it gets him anywhere he can see.</p>",
     "chat": ""
    },
